                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is without a doubt the worst game I've played in the last 10 years. The only good thing I can say about this game is the concept sounded interesting. The game play is awful. The story line is childish. It's seriously repetitive. And what's the deal with that Jar Jar Binks sounding professor? Was this someones high school science project? Thank God it was on sale. I'd be pissed if I'd payed full price for this. As it is I'm just sad that games like these exist on Steam. Maybe I'll finish it someday when I'm really, really, really, really, really, really, really bored.",
